{"game":"Tower Defense (Last Kingdom)","table":"EventTowerDefenseScenarioListTable","name":"ScenarioList","columns":[{"key":"id","label":"Id"},{"key":"dialog_list_group_id","label":"Dialog list group id"},{"key":"speaker","label":"Speaker"},{"key":"speaker_position","label":"Speaker position"},{"key":"speaker_team","label":"Speaker team"},{"key":"scenario_localkey","label":"Scenario localkey"},{"key":"print_cutscene","label":"Print cutscene"}],"rows":[[1001010101,10010101,"crown","Left","Ally","We can't allow a single Rapture into the kingdom.",""],[1001010102,10010101,"crown","Left","Ally","We have to defend this place no matter what.",""],[1001010103,10010101,"marian","Right","Ally","Yes!",""],[1001010104,10010101,"kilo","Right","Ally","I-I understand!",""],[1001010105,10010101,"crown","Left","Ally","Put your trust in me and fight.",""],[1001010106,10010101,"crown","Left","Ally","I have faith in each and every one of you.",""],[1001010107,10010101,"marian","Right","Ally","We won't fail you!",""],[1001010108,10010101,"kilo","Right","Ally","Look at that swarm of Raptures! T.A.L.O.S., what are our chances of victory?",""],[1001010109,10010101,"talos","Left","Ally","92%.",""],[1001010110,10010101,"kilo","Right","Ally","What?",""],[1001010111,10010101,"talos","Left","Ally","We have the Heretic Modernia and Pilgrims on our side. This is a battle we will not lose.",""],[1001010112,10010101,"kilo","Right","Ally","Phew... guess I got scared for nothing.",""],[1001020101,10010201,"crown","Left","Ally","Is everyone ready?",""],[1001020102,10010201,"kilo","Right","Ally","Ready!",""],[1001020103,10010201,"marian","Right","Ally","There should be more time in between each wave.",""],[1001020104,10010201,"marian","Right","Ally","Raptures usually move in groups.",""],[1001020105,10010201,"marian","Right","Ally","We've already fended off one assault. There shouldn't have been another one for a while.",""],[1001020106,10010201,"crown","Left","Ally","Now's not the time to ask questions. We just have to defend the castle.",""],[1001020107,10010201,"marian","Right","Ally","...",""],[1001020108,10010201,"marian","Right","Ally","Kilo. Can you ask T.A.L.O.S. to record all the movements of the Raptures?",""],[1001020109,10010201,"kilo","Right","Ally","Sure, that should be possible.",""],[1001020110,10010201,"kilo","Right","Ally","Is it, T.A.L.O.S.?",""],[1001020111,10010201,"talos","Left","Ally","Affirmative. I have made records of previous skirmishes as well.",""],[1001020112,10010201,"talos","Left","Ally","I will compare them with the intel gathered from this battle.",""],[1001020113,10010201,"kilo","Right","Ally","I knew I could count on you.",""],[1001020114,10010201,"talos","Left","Ally","Thank you.",""],[1001020115,10010201,"crown","Left","Ally","Here they come. Get ready.",""],[1001030101,10010301,"marian","Left","Ally","Thankfully, there aren't that many.",""],[1001030102,10010301,"marian","Left","Ally","The two of us can handle them with no problem.",""],[1001030103,10010301,"kilo","Right","Ally","Uh...",""],[1001030104,10010301,"marian","Left","Ally","... Kilo.",""],[1001030105,10010301,"kilo","Right","Ally","I-I...",""],[1001030106,10010301,"kilo","Right","Ally","I'm sorry. I can't get that image of Chime out of my head.",""],[1001030107,10010301,"marian","Left","Ally","I will never let that happen to you.",""],[1001030108,10010301,"marian","Left","Ally","Crown will be back anytime now. All we have to do is hold out a bit longer.",""],[1001030109,10010301,"kilo","Right","Ally","O-okay!",""],[1001030110,10010301,"marian","Left","Ally","...",""],[1001030201,10010302,"talkative","Right","Foe","...",""],[1001030202,10010302,"marian","Left","Ally","!!",""],[1001030203,10010302,"kilo","Left","Ally","It can't be...",""],[1001030204,10010302,"talos","Left","Ally","Yes, the special entity, Chatterbox.",""],[1001030205,10010302,"kilo","Left","Ally","What's that thing doing here?!",""],[1001030206,10010302,"talos","Left","Ally","Unable to determine.",""],[1001030207,10010302,"kilo","Left","Ally","I realize that!",""],[1001030208,10010302,"marian","Left","Ally","Be careful. That doesn't seem like an ordinary foe.",""],[1001030209,10010302,"talkative","Right","Foe","So, you really were here.",""],[1001030210,10010302,"talkative","Right","Foe","Hahaha! What luck!",""],[1001030211,10010302,"talkative","Right","Foe","The time has come to recover what was taken from me.",""],[1001030301,10010303,"kilo","Right","Ally","!!",""],[1001030302,10010303,"marian","Left","Ally","There's so many of them!",""],[1001030303,10010303,"kilo","Right","Ally","There's no way we can hold out!",""],[1001030304,10010303,"talos","Left","Ally","The probability of success is 4%.",""],[1001030305,10010303,"kilo","Right","Ally","I know that! If anything, that's higher than I thought it'd be.",""],[1001030306,10010303,"marian","Left","Ally","We have to do what we can,",""],[1001030307,10010303,"marian","Left","Ally","for this is Crown and Chime's...",""],[1001030308,10010303,"talkative","Right","Foe","It's over.",""],[1001030309,10010303,"kilo","Left","Ally","No! The kingdom!",""],[1001030310,10010303,"marian","Left","Ally","Is this where it ends...?",""],[1001030401,10010304,"snowwhite","Right","Union","We're here.",""],[1001030402,10010304,"hongryeon","Right","Union","Surely, thou could have uttered a more impressive line. \"Kept you waiting, huh?\" and the like?",""],[1001030403,10010304,"rapunzel","Right","Union","She's right. We're getting less and less cool with every passing day.",""],[1001030404,10010304,"marian","Left","Ally","Snow White! Scarlet! Rapunzel!",""],[1001030405,10010304,"kilo","Left","Ally","Wh-who are these people?",""],[1001030406,10010304,"talkative","Right","Foe","!!",""],[1001030407,10010304,"snowwhite","Right","Union","We'll talk later.",""],[1001030408,10010304,"hongryeon","Right","Union","Yes, let's go.",""],[1001030409,10010304,"rapunzel","Right","Union","Time to put a stop to this.",""],[1001030410,10010304,"snowwhite","Right","Union","Pioneer squad. Ready.",""],[1001030411,10010304,"snowwhite","Right","Union","Encounter.",""],[1001030501,10010305,"talkative","Right","Foe","You may have won this time, but it is no matter.",""],[1001030502,10010305,"talkative","Right","Foe","I'm quite satisfied with how things are progressing.",""],[1001040101,10010401,"snowwhite","Right","Ally","They're coming.",""],[1001040102,10010401,"hongryeon","Right","Ally","Their numbers are most prodigious.",""],[1001040103,10010401,"rapunzel","Right","Ally","They just keep coming and coming.",""],[1001040104,10010401,"kilo","Left","Ally","This is why recapturing the surface is impossible.",""],[1001040105,10010401,"kilo","Left","Ally","Their forces are infinite.",""],[1001040106,10010401,"crown","Left","Ally","No. Nothing is truly infinite.",""],[1001040107,10010401,"crown","Left","Ally","Everything has an end.",""],[1001040108,10010401,"hongryeon","Right","Ally","I agree.",""],[1001040109,10010401,"marian","Left","Ally","Let's rout them.",""],[1001040201,10010402,"talkative","Right","Foe","...",""],[1001040202,10010402,"indivilia","Right","Foe","It's a bit of a shame. This little hovel has its own modest charms.",""],[1001040203,10010402,"indivilia","Right","Foe","I almost feel bad for what I'm about to do to it.",""],[1001040204,10010402,"talos","Left","Ally","The Heretic and the special individual have joined the battle.",""],[1001040205,10010402,"kilo","Left","Ally","They're arriving at the same time?!",""],[1001040206,10010402,"snowwhite","Left","Ally","Chatterbox. It's been a while.",""],[1001040207,10010402,"talkative","Right","Foe","That is has.",""],[1001040208,10010402,"snowwhite","Left","Ally","Not long enough.",""],[1001040209,10010402,"talkative","Right","Foe","Hehe, impudent as ever, I see.",""],[1001040210,10010402,"indivilia","Right","Foe","I haven't forgotten what you did to me back there.",""],[1001040211,10010402,"crown","Left","Ally","I hope you never do.",""],[1001040212,10010402,"indivilia","Right","Foe","I'll kill you for that.",""],[1001040213,10010402,"crown","Left","Ally","I'd like to see you try.",""],[1001040301,10010403,"kilo","Left","Ally","Wha... she caught it?!",""],[1001040401,10010404,"talos","Left","Ally","Nanomachines are dispersing from the Heretic's body.",""],[1001040402,10010404,"talos","Left","Ally","It appears to be entering some sort of transformation.",""],[1001040403,10010404,"kilo","Left","Ally","!!",""],[1001040404,10010404,"indivilia","Right","Foe","I hope you enjoyed that feeling of victory, brief as it was,",""],[1001040405,10010404,"indivilia","Right","Foe","because now despair is all that awaits you.",""],[1001050101,10010501,"kilo","Left","Ally","!!",""],[1001050102,10010501,"kilo","Left","Ally","Chatterbox is approaching!",""],[1001050103,10010501,"talkative","Right","Foe","...",""],[1001050104,10010501,"snowwhite","Left","Ally","Looks like it's taking the lead.",""],[1001050105,10010501,"talkative","Right","Foe","Provoking us, are you? I'm impressed.",""],[1001050106,10010501,"talkative","Right","Foe","Not only that, but you've narrowed all the entrances down to only one.",""],[1001050107,10010501,"talkative","Right","Foe","Your strategy is so painfully obvious that it's laughable.",""],[1001050108,10010501,"talkative","Right","Foe","All your careful planning will crumble in the face of our sheer might.",""],[1001050109,10010501,"crown","Left","Ally","Here it comes.",""],[1001050110,10010501,"snowwhite","Left","Ally","This is where we take them.",""],[1001050111,10010501,"hongryeon","Left","Ally","Let's give it a try.",""],[1001050112,10010501,"rapunzel","Left","Ally","Stay strong, everyone.",""],[1001060101,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","Chatterbox is a fool,",""],[1001060102,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","but now that it has evolved once again,",""],[1001060103,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","I'm very much looking forward to what happens next.",""],[1001060104,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","Such power just from ingesting one...",""],[1001060105,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","I wonder,",""],[1001060106,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","what would happen if he were to consume you?",""],[1001060107,10010601,"marian","Left","Ally","...",""],[1001060108,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","I don't think Chatterbox intends on doing such a thing,",""],[1001060109,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","but the mere thought of it is enough to send tingles down my spine.",""],[1001060110,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","I want to see that dream made a reality.",""],[1001060111,10010601,"indivilia","Right","Foe","I'll finish you quickly.",""],[1001060112,10010601,"chime","Left","Ally","So, you showed up right from the jump transformed, did you?",""],[1001060113,10010601,"crown","Left","Ally","We're ready for you.",""],[1002010101,10020101,"shifty","Left","Ally","I'll make the first move.",""],[1002010102,10020101,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","I don't see Mega Mecha Shifty anywhere.",""],[1002010103,10020101,"shifty","Left","Ally","Bosses always show up later.",""],[1002010104,10020101,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Enemy units approaching.",""],[1002010105,10020101,"shifty","Left","Ally","Good. Let's engage.",""],[1002010106,10020101,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Encounter!",""],[1002010201,10020102,"shifty","Left","Ally","They're hiding in the water!",""],[1002010202,10020102,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","I knew training them to launch from the swimming pool would pay off.",""],[1002010203,10020102,"shifty","Left","Ally","But if they go underwater, won't they break down?",""],[1002010204,10020102,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","No, their waterproofing is flawless,",""],[1002010205,10020102,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","because I'm the one who made them!",""],[1002010206,10020102,"shifty","Left","Ally","I wouldn't be so boastful. These creations of yours are attacking the Ark.",""],[1002010207,10020102,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Be careful. Mega Mecha Shifty is strong.",""],[1002010208,10020102,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Naturally, because I created it.",""],[1002010209,10020102,"shifty","Left","Ally","I told you to stop bragging!",""],[1002010301,10020103,"shifty","Left","Ally","It's not going down! It's too big!",""],[1002010302,10020103,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","That's because I'm the one who made it!",""],[1002010303,10020103,"shifty","Left","Ally","Is there any weak point?",""],[1002010304,10020103,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","A weak point?",""],[1002010305,10020103,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","It is a bit ticklish around the ears and the nape of the neck.",""],[1002010306,10020103,"shifty","Left","Ally","That's not what I meant! I mean somewhere that is susceptible to damage.",""],[1002010307,10020103,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Oh. No, none.",""],[1002010308,10020103,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Because I made it!",""],[1002010309,10020103,"shifty","Left","Ally","Mecha Shifty, don't you have self-destruct capabilities?",""],[1002010310,10020103,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Yes.",""],[1002010311,10020103,"shifty","Left","Ally","Why don't you use it?",""],[1002010312,10020103,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Any world without me in it, is a world bereft of meaning.",""],[1002010313,10020103,"shifty","Left","Ally","Agh! It's approaching!",""],[1002010314,10020103,"shifty","Left","Ally","What are we gonna do?!",""],[1002010315,10020103,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","...",""],[1002010401,10020104,"shifty","Left","Ally","Huh? What are those brightly colored units?",""],[1002010402,10020104,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","My allies. Mecha Shifty Rangers.",""],[1002010403,10020104,"shifty","Left","Ally","You didn't mention anything about them!",""],[1002010404,10020104,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Sure I did.",""],[1002010405,10020104,"shifty","Left","Ally","You did?",""],[1002010406,10020104,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","I was going to, but didn't have enough time to mention it.",""],[1002010407,10020104,"shifty","Left","Ally","So in other words, you didn't mention it.",""],[1002010408,10020104,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Quiet!",""],[1002010409,10020104,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Mecha Shifty Rangers!",""],[1002010410,10020104,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","We have come here to prove we are the superior species!",""],[1002010411,10020104,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Watch carefully, inferior beings, and gaze upon the ultimate race!",""],[1002010412,10020104,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Mechaaaa Shifffttyyyyy!",""],[1002010413,10020104,"shifty","Left","Ally","... Whatever happens, happens.",""],[1002010501,10020105,"shifty","Left","Ally","Did you take it down?",""],[1002010502,10020105,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","A resurrection spell is being cast.",""],[1002010601,10020106,"shifty","Left","Ally","Gah! It resurrected!",""],[1002010602,10020106,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","It appears I have no choice.",""],[1002010603,10020106,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","I was planning on saving this for my final battle against the inferior species, but...",""],[1002010604,10020106,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Mecha Shifty Rangers! Unleash the ultimate weapon!",""],[1002010605,10020106,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Energy charging initiated!",""],[1002010701,10020107,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Galaxy Destroyer, fire!",{"img":"scene_finalattck"}],[1002010702,10020107,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","Become light!",""],[1002010801,10020108,"shifty","Left","Ally","A-amazing...!",""],[1002010802,10020108,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","To uphold peace in the Ark,",""],[1002010803,10020108,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","and for my own well-being,",""],[1002010804,10020108,"mechashifty_01","Right","Ally","I, Mecha Shifty, will always fight.",""],[1002010805,10020108,"shifty","Left","Ally","So you were originally planning to use this on us?",""]]}